<!-- Example of Digital NOTAM for a runway portion closure. First 300 m of RWY 09R at DONLON/INTL. are closed:
  
     Runway/Runway Direction: EADH 09R/27L 09R
                  Start Time: 2027-11-10 06:00
                    End Time: 2027-11-13 20:00
                    Schedule: -
       Geographical Accuracy: 1 M
                   Elevation: 14 M
                    Geometry: Polygon
               Extent Closed: first 300m
              Closure Reason: maintenance work
                        Note: Updated RWY CL point locations and declared distances will be communicated by subsequent NOTAMs.
                              Updated declared distances for RWY 27L will be communicated by subsequent NOTAM
  
     This event (RWE.CLS) triggers the displacement of 3 Runway Centerline Points on RWY 09R (see file DN_RCP.CHG_1_multiple_RCP_displaced_on_RWY09R_due_to_RWE.CLS.xml) and
     the change of Declared Distances for the opposite runway (RWY 27L) (see file DN_RDD.CHG_1_new_declared_distances_on_RWY27L_due_to_RCP.CHG_on_RWY09R.xml) -->

